{
  "description": "QR route selection shared by Apple and web. mode is 'official', 'directLink' or 'eraticCard'; expected is the exact QR payload or null. Official mode never substitutes a provider link; direct mode never substitutes the official mapping. The eraticCard mode (game-rules.md section 8.2) carries `eratic` {host, deckId}, ignores the card's links and official mapping, and yields https://<host>/c/<deckId>/<card id>, or null when the host is invalid or the deck ID does not match the deck ID pattern.",
